Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:53:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] Ming-Image: image editing with reference images (vision
 tower, reference latents)

Vision tower and projection (MingVision*, --ming-vision converter), reference frames in the Z-Image
graph and rotary embedding, encoder with picture tokens and block positions, UNet condition
indexing shifted for trailing reference latents, kontext modifier plumbing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
